# Patterns of the secret scan of `senior-mode check` (#143), one per line, tab separated:
#   kind <TAB> mode <TAB> extended regex (grep -E)
# The secret is what a finding is allowlisted by: `<sha256 of the secret> <reason>` in
# .claude/secret-allowlist of the base branch. Modes:
#   token   the match is the secret, case sensitive.
#   assign  a value assigned to a name such as password or token, case insensitive; the secret is the
#           value, without the name or quotes. Kept only when it has a letter and a digit, no
#           placeholder word, no bracket or parenthesis, and is not a dotted identifier.
#   url     a URL with credentials, the user possibly empty (redis://:pw@host); the secret is the whole
#           match. Kept unless the password is a template (${X}, $(X), $X, {X}, %(x)s, %s, <x>, ***)
#           or, as a whole, a placeholder word (password, changeme, your_password, test...), digits kept.
#   block   a private key; the secret is the whole key, from the header line to the `-----END` line,
#           lines joined by a newline.
AWS access key	token	(AKIA|ASIA|AGPA|AIDA|AROA)[0-9A-Z]{16}
GitHub token	token	gh[pousr]_[A-Za-z0-9]{36,}
GitHub token	token	github_pat_[A-Za-z0-9_]{22,}
GitLab token	token	glpat-[0-9A-Za-z_-]{20,}
npm token	token	npm_[A-Za-z0-9]{36,}
Stripe key	token	[sr]k_(live|test)_[0-9A-Za-z]{16,}
Stripe key	token	whsec_[0-9A-Za-z]{24,}
Slack token	token	xox[abpors]-[0-9A-Za-z-]{10,}
Slack token	token	https://hooks\.slack\.com/services/T[A-Z0-9]+/B[A-Z0-9]+/[A-Za-z0-9]+
Google API key	token	AIza[0-9A-Za-z_-]{35}
Google API key	token	GOCSPX-[0-9A-Za-z_-]{28}
OpenAI key	token	sk-[A-Za-z0-9]{20,}
OpenAI key	token	sk-proj-[A-Za-z0-9_-]{20,}
Anthropic key	token	sk-ant-[A-Za-z0-9_-]{20,}
SendGrid key	token	SG\.[A-Za-z0-9_-]{20,}\.[A-Za-z0-9_-]{30,}
Azure storage key	token	AccountKey=[A-Za-z0-9+/]{40,}={0,2}
credentialed URL	url	[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9+.-]*://[^/[:space:]:@]*:[^/[:space:]@]+@[^[:space:]]+
JSON Web Token	token	eyJ[A-Za-z0-9_-]{10,}\.eyJ[A-Za-z0-9_-]{10,}\.[A-Za-z0-9_-]{10,}
private key	block	-----BEGIN ([A-Z]+ )*PRIVATE KEY( BLOCK)?-----
generic secret	assign	(password|passwd|secret|token|api[_-]?key|auth[_-]?key|private[_-]?key|credential)[A-Za-z0-9_.-]*["']?[[:space:]]*[:=][[:space:]]*["']?[A-Za-z0-9+/_@!#%^&*~-][^]["'(){}<>[:space:]]{15,}
